        "created_at": "2015-05-19T16:48:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I finally had time to watch a thing that you did, I thought it was very good.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>There was enough internal consistancy within the script that I was able to guess the <font color=\"white\">mummy \"twist\"</font> but still enough unknowns to make it enjoyable, too many pilots give it all away in the opening.</p>",
